   "stimulus_html": "<figure class=\"unnumbered\">\n<img src=\"exercises/media/6fa09df283192c18.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n<figcaption>(credit: modification of work by  Jennifer Knudtson, MD and Jessica E. McLaughlin, MD/Merck Manual)</figcaption>\n</figure>\n",
